<title>UK: Merrill Lynch leads $324 mln asset-backed FRN.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch leads $324 mln asset-backed FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MLCC MORTGAGE INVESTORS INC 1997-A</p>
<p> AMT    $324,728	BASE	 1M-LIBOR  LEGAL MAT     .OCT.26</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +25 BP    PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS GLOBAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> NOTES	AVG LIFE 5.38 YRS. PLUS 11 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
